00:36:31.876 --> 00:36:33.810
the writers were going
through at the time.

00:36:33.810 --> 00:36:36.660
If you know the cultural
context in which it was written,

00:36:37.593 --> 00:36:39.390
it illuminates the texts in a way.

00:36:39.390 --> 00:36:41.690
And I'm not talking about back in the day,

