thing from every single angle,

01:34:10.280 --> 01:34:13.110
but it's kind of amazing how

01:34:14.390 --> 01:34:16.420
ineffective it is for me personally.

01:34:16.420 --> 01:34:18.730
I'm sure it's gonna be very
effective for some people.

01:34:18.730 --> 01:34:19.920
I'm just saying that if you're

01:34:19.920 --> 01:34:22.560
