01:34:22.560 --> 01:34:23.980
it's just like, oh wow.

01:34:23.980 --> 01:34:25.060
Well it's, again,

01:34:25.060 --> 01:34:27.530
it's not after you've lost your faith,

01:34:27.530 --> 01:34:28.930
it's before your lose your faith.

01:34:28.930 --> 01:34:30.510
Yeah, I agree.

01:34:30.510 --> 01:34:33.170
Before you fall backwards into something

01:34:33.170 --> 01:34:37.370
that you're probably
gonna hit your head on,

01:34:37.370 --> 01:34:38.220
read this book.

01:34:38.220 --> 01:34:40.320
That's what the cover says--

01:34:40.320 --> 01:34:41.153
And listen,

01:34:42.009 --> 01:34:44.290
I'm not making light of the
people who wrote this book,

01:34:44.290 --> 01:34:46.730
because I said for a fact,

01:34:46.730 --> 01:34:49.760
I don't know what I
think about the multiple,

01:34:49.760 --> 01:34:50.853
you know, universes,

01:34:51.980 --> 01:34:53.507
multiple worlds theory,
whatever you call it,

01:34:53.507 --> 01:34:56.070
but there is a Rhett who tried to,

01:34:56.070 --> 01:34:58.570
maybe got rejected, but tried
to contribute to this book.

01:34:58.570 --> 01:34:59.403
Definitely.

01:34:59.403 --> 01:35:00.990
In another universe.
Absolutely.

01:35:00.990 --> 01:35:03.120
And so I do not fault you,

01:35:03.120 --> 01:35:05.530
for this is exactly what I would be

01:35:05.530 --> 01:35:07.900
